# DriveMutation environment placeholders — do not put real secrets here.
# Stage 1 is fully deterministic (no keys required).
# Stage 2 optionally uses ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (via .env.local) ONLY to paraphrase
# natural-language testing goals — never for labels, numbers, or mutations.
# Stage 3 uses OPENAI_API_KEY (via .env.local preferred) for baseline eval,
# supervised fine-tuning, and compile endpoints — server-side only.

